flowchart TD
  A[Sign in] --> B[Select owner-provided Brand Kit]
  B --> C[Create caption and upload image]
  C --> D{Valid input?}
  D -- No --> E[Readable validation error]
  E --> C
  D -- Yes --> F[Analyze image and caption]
  F --> G[Inspect palette, tags, risk and missing-model flags]
  G --> H{Revise?}
  H -- Yes --> C
  H -- No --> I[Submit to different reviewer]
  I --> J{Decision}
  J -- Changes required --> C
  J -- Approve --> K[Mark ready for manual publishing]
